  clock: 11  # acc7
  nonce: acc7  # acc7
  set:  # acc7
    fields:  # acc7
      root_cause: "di-resolution reads the FILESYSTEM, not the in-memory IR: extract_bindings_from_source walks find_non_test_files(root, _SOURCE_GLOBS) and read_masked_source's every match -- 396 files measured at tip. The filed files_analyzed=0 was a MISSING COUNTER, never a measurement, and derive_silence_reason converted it into a false positive claim of silence_reason='no_candidate_files'. Counter fixed in PR #1005 (now 396 files / 'unreported'). The remaining defect is cost-only: the pass declares activation=LinkerActivation(always=True) explicitly and so runs with no DI markers present -- 988 ms / 0.48% of pass time at tip, down from 2550 ms / 2.7% as filed."  # acc7
